{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15847","headline":"赠元秘书 · 崔峒","name":"赠元秘书","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旧书稍稍出风尘，孤客逢秋感此身。\n秦地谬爲门下客，淮阴徒笑市中人。\n也闻阮籍寻常醉，见说陈平不久贫。\n幸有故人茅屋在，更将心事问情亲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔峒","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15847.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15847","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}